WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Autonomy under human control. Natural language. Visual navigation.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Command in plain language. Define the objective. C2 prepares the mission.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Human control. Review the plan. Approve and start.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Autonomous exploration. GNSS-denied navigation with vision and onboard mapping.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Object detection review. Optional image review. Following is automatic.

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.000
A map that evolves. Track movement. Clear newly observed free space.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Operator control. Interrupt following. Command the return.
